            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Publish a styled drag-to-Applications disk image with each release so first installs follow the usual Mac pattern, while Sparkle keeps updating from the zip.
- Skip releases for pushes that only change YAML, since workflow and config edits don't change the app.
- Use actions/checkout v7 so releases run on Node 24 instead of the deprecated Node 20.
]]></description>
